  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-30T13:59:11.229Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As a creator in VRChat i am often filming showcases for avatars and such. Myself and a lot of creators prefer to film our own videos as opposed to having to spend what is often quite a bit of money for someone else to do it. What would be super handy would be if we could preset a path for the camera to move on with a simple play, stop, loop and reset menu in order to get moving shots. \nCurrently the drone system is the closest we’ve got to this but it is difficult to control and extremely hard work when trying to multitask the filming and “being” in the video. \nI know you would be doing a lot of people a favour and also boosting a positive outlook on VRC as a whole if this feature was to be added. Thank you!",
